{
  "formatVersion": 3,
  "id": "tau.html",
  "name": "HTML",
  "description": "在文档中编辑行内与块级 HTML，支持 Tailwind 样式、博客发布和静态导出。",
  "categories": [
    "editor",
    "ai"
  ],
  "keywords": [
